          "C) Nations should abandon international climate treaties.",
          "D) Privatization of aquifers has eliminated global water shortages."
        ],
        "answer": 1,
        "explanation": "<strong>🧠 Logical Framework:</strong> Contrasts Hardin's pessimism with Ostrom's polycentric community governance model."
      }
    ]
